# Build output
publish/
Releases/
dist/
bin/
obj/
logs/

# Throwaway detached-test-run logs (deleted when a run finishes; may be file-locked)
testrun.*.log

# Local tools (portable git/gh)
.tools/

# User documents and local data — never push these.
# NOTE: "/*.pdf" only matches PDF files at the repo root; a bare "*.pdf" would
# also ignore the src/WatermarkRemover.Pdf project folder (case-insensitive on
# Windows) and break CI with MSB3202.
/*.pdf
WatermarkRemover.settings.json
*.user
.vs/

# Brother iPrint&Scan 逆向复刻产物 —— 仅在本机保留，不推送。
# 复刻原型与逆向证据的目标是整合进办公助理软件，不进入本仓库；
# 其中 research/brother-ipscan 还含反编译与字符串提取证据，不应上传。
/ipscan-clone/
/research/

# Trae IDE 工作目录（AI 规划文档、skills）——本地工作笔记，不入库。
/.trae/
